  "status": "applied",
  "key": "thumbnail_format",
  "value": "webp",
  "rationale": "The project's current evidence confirms that all three formats — png (80 KB), jpeg (30 KB), and webp (20 KB) — pass both browser compatibility and pipeline tests. WebP is the smallest supported format at 20 KB, making it the correct choice for minimising thumbnail payload on the web."
